# Terraform (infra/windows-test-vm).
# State is the important one: it holds the lab VM's local-account password in plaintext,
# along with the bucket name and instance id. It must never be committed.
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored: pinning provider versions is the same
# discipline this project applies to every other dependency.
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Asgard packaged build (Asgard/packaging/build.py): venv, PyInstaller work folder, dist and zips.
Asgard/build/
